are better logical reasoning.

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.980
So the models can--

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:27.500
we've covered a lot of
previous lectures on the models

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.760
learn how to reason better.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:31.420
So the reasoning
capabilities definitely drive

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:33.260
some of these improvements.

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:35.200
Code generation
capabilities have improved.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:37.260
So we have covered
several lectures

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.900
where you've seen the models do
better on the code generation

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:40.400
side.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:43.300
So that's definitely driving
some of these improvements.

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:43.860
Too use.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:45.780
So we covered React
and several papers

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:48.120
around just how the
models use tools.

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.780
So that also has added up.

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:52.700
And then in general,
