00:15:58.540 --> 00:15:59.900
over and over again.

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:02.820
And finally, you want these
models to generally recover

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:03.520
from errors.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:05.562
I mean, if you're going
to do an eight-hour task,

00:16:05.562 --> 00:16:08.600
