00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:17.140
And some notion of
state of or memory of,

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:18.260
what is the final goal?

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:20.740
And how far along are you
in terms of making progress

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:23.580
towards that goal?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.460
Other aspects of
what folks have seen

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.540
as driving these improvements.

