What is the common
failure pattern?

00:24:55.350 --> 00:24:59.270
[INAUDIBLE]

00:24:59.270 --> 00:25:03.550
Human reader or
self-inflicted pain.

00:25:03.550 --> 00:25:05.550
So you evaluate
the model yourself

00:25:05.550 --> 00:25:07.390
and see where it's failing.

