00:25:21.190 --> 00:25:22.690
OK.

00:25:22.690 --> 00:25:25.770
So some of the challenges
in this benchmark.

00:25:25.770 --> 00:25:28.950
So no benchmark is ever perfect.

00:25:28.950 --> 00:25:30.930
Every benchmark has
some challenges.

00:25:30.930 --> 00:25:33.590
So some of the things that
[INAUDIBLE] did get right

00:25:33.590 --> 00:25:35.630
is that it's the first
attempt at measuring,

00:25:35.630 --> 00:25:37.390
what is the time
